DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44727::$$$message_0390_0000_0000$$$::"Hello, everyone. If this is our first time meeting, the pleasure is all mine. I'm Ayaka Sajyou."::
44728::$$$message_0390_0000_0001$$$::"To make a long story short, I'm a Master in the Holy Grail War."::
44729::$$$message_0390_0000_0002$$$::"My Master rank is seventh, the lowest. I'm weak[line len=2]the weakest, actually. To be frank, I'd like to drop out right now, but circumstances won't allow it."::
44730::$$$message_0390_0000_0003$$$::"I also don't have any next of kin. My father died in the last Holy Grail War, and my big sister who was a Master last time...is another long story."::
44731::$$$message_0390_0000_0004$$$::"Ayaka.[wvl canskip=false time=150] You haven't checked your mail this morning, have you? I'll go bring it in for you. Let's have tea after you eat, as well."::
44732::$$$message_0390_0000_0005$$$::"He's Saber, the very first Servant I summoned and made a pact with."::
44733::$$$message_0390_0000_0006$$$::"He's the perfect Prince Charming every girl dreams of, and he makes me feel awkward because he's just too perfect."::
44734::$$$message_0390_0000_0007$$$::"He's also a little airheaded."::
44735::$$$message_0390_0000_0008$$$::"Sup, morning. Ooh, there's extra ham in the fridge. Add some thin-cut bread and eggs...and you've got yourself a breakfast."::
44736::$$$message_0390_0000_0009$$$::"That's Lancer. We used to be enemies, but now he stays over at my house. He's a barbarian who raids my refrigerator."::
44737::$$$message_0390_0000_0010$$$::"He's almost a squatter, but since he's helped me out of several sticky situations, I at least owe him that much. Life's all about give and take, right?"::
44738::$$$message_0390_0000_0011$$$::"...And, well, if you look past his rough edges, he's the most understanding of the bunch."::
44739::$$$message_0390_0000_0012$$$::"Why so glum in the morning, lass? Are you nitpicking yourself again? Try not to be too hard on yourself, all right?"::
44740::$$$message_0390_0000_0013$$$::"The last person I want to hear that from is our fridge bandit. Leave me alone. [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=綾香 face=楽2 pos=right time=400 twno=1]...Are you off today, Lancer?"::
44741::$$$message_0390_0000_0014$$$::"Yeah, I'm free all day. I thought I'd either do some gardening at your house, or play with the dogs."::
44742::$$$message_0390_0000_0015$$$::"I'm sorry to say that gardening is my job. We don't need you to do that. Why don't you go back to your own house, Lancer?"::
44743::$$$message_0390_0000_0016$$$::"I've always been a freelancer. The lass asked me to be her bodyguard, and I intend to do my job."::
44744::$$$message_0390_0000_0017$$$::"There's still a few scoundrels out there. [wvl][hfwww layer=0]Like a certain wolf who dresses up like a prince."::
44745::$$$message_0390_0000_0018$$$::"Well, look at a feral dog calling someone a wolf. I'm not sure if I should feel honored or insulted. [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=セイバーprt face=笑顔 pos=right time=300 twno=1][hfsigh layer=1]What do you think, Ayaka?"::
44746::$$$message_0390_0000_0019$$$::"I don't care. [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=綾香 face=楽4 pos=left time=400 twno=1]Anyway, what are the envelopes for? I see two of them."::
44747::$$$message_0390_0000_0020$$$::"They seem to have arrived this morning. Here you go."::
44748::$$$message_0390_0000_0021$$$::"Um..."::
44749::$$$message_0390_0000_0022$$$::"'Have you heard of the onsen that grants any wish? Visit the greatest and oldest hot spot in Fuyuki...'"::
44750::$$$message_0390_0000_0023$$$::"'But only the first visiting group's wish will come true. Be prepared should you visit us,' [wvl canskip=false time=300][hffgchg2 chara=綾香 face=照れ2 pos=left time=400 twno=1]it says. What is this, a prank?"::
44751::$$$message_0390_0000_0024$$$::"...Wow. An invitation to another Holy Grail War? Do you hold these things all over the place?"::
44752::$$$message_0390_0000_0025$$$::"I'd assume it operates under different rules. Here's the other envelope, Ayaka."::
44753::$$$message_0390_0000_0026$$$::"This one's a note, and...a single Shinkansen ticket?"::
44754::$$$message_0390_0000_0027$$$::"Um, 'I'll be waiting for you at Fuyuki's Holy Grail Onsen[heart]'[wvl][hffg chara=綾香 face=哀 pos=left time=400 twno=1][hfsweat layer=0 ox=0 oy=0] ...They're totally making fun of us."::
44755::$$$message_0390_0000_0028$$$::"So the Fuyuki Holy Grail is a hot spring bath. Ours was a cauldron straight out of hell. They sound kind of similar."::
44756::$$$message_0390_0000_0029$$$::"An onsen, eh? That doesn't sound too bad. It's the lass's decision, though."::
44757::$$$message_0390_0000_0030$$$::"What are you gonna do? They must be cautious if they went to the trouble of sending a letter. Are you going to join at the last minute?"::
44758::$$$message_0390_0000_0031$$$::"That doesn't exactly fit into my life plans, but..."::
44759::$$$message_0390_0000_0032$$$::(The invitation comes off as snide and irritating, somehow. But if it really grants wishes...)::
44760::$$$message_0390_0000_0033$$$::"I've heard everything!"::
44761::$$$message_0390_0000_0034$$$::"Archer!? How did you get in here!?"::
44762::$$$message_0390_0000_0035$$$::"Through the window, of course! Don't sweat the details, Ayaka. It would spoil your lovely, flamingo-like profile."::
44763::$$$message_0390_0000_0036$$$::"...Is that your idea of a compliment, mate?"::
44764::$$$message_0390_0000_0037$$$::"...What are you doing here, Archer? As you can see, we're in the middle of breakfast. If you're here to request a duel, then knock on the front door in an hour."::
44765::$$$message_0390_0000_0038$$$::"Ha, fool! And you call yourselves peerless Heroic Spirits?"::
44766::$$$message_0390_0000_0039$$$::"I go wherever the battlefield is. I answer all challenges, crush my enemies, and plunder their riches..."::
44767::$$$message_0390_0000_0040$$$::"I don't know where or what this war is about, but it's only right for Heroic Spirits to fight for the Grail. [wvl][hfwww layer=1]How can I call myself a primeval Heroic Spirit[line len=2]no, a Holy Grail War Senpai if I don't take part!?"::
44768::$$$message_0390_0000_0041$$$::"..."::
44769::$$$message_0390_0000_0042$$$::"...Hmph. You're as impulsive as ever. If you just want to fight, then go do it on your own. I won't let you put Ayaka at risk."::
44771::$$$message_0390_0000_0044$$$::"You're so overprotective. Girls these days aren't as frail as you think, Saber."::
44772::$$$message_0390_0000_0045$$$::"Then what, are you here to invade a girl's home?"::
44773::$$$message_0390_0000_0046$$$::"I...I've never even considered doing anything so savage."::
44774::$$$message_0390_0000_0047$$$::"Okay, let's go, Saber. We're going to this Holy Grail Onsen. Get ready to leave."::
44775::$$$message_0390_0000_0048$$$::"Ayaka!? [wvl canskip=false time=200][wm canskip=0][hffgchg2 chara=セイバーprt face=困惑 pos=left time=400 twno=1]...Haah. I suppose you've already made up your mind. Oh well. I'll accompany you, even if I think this is ill-advised."::
44776::$$$message_0390_0000_0049$$$::"Need a good spear, lass? I'll lend you mine."::
44777::$$$message_0390_0000_0050$$$::"Of course you're coming too, Lancer. Archer, too. All four of us are going to conquer Fuyuki."::
44778::$$$message_0390_0000_0051$$$::"Now that's what I like to hear. My princess knows when it's time to strike!"::
44779::$$$message_0390_0000_0052$$$::"We're leaving in 20 minutes. I'm going to go and gather bird feathers from the garden, so wait for me."::
44780::$$$message_0390_0000_0053$$$::"Now you've gone and done it, Archer. You're always a terrible influence on Ayaka."::
44781::$$$message_0390_0000_0054$$$::"Ayaka can be the judge of that. Your opinion doesn't count. [wvl canskip=false time=150][hffgchg2 chara=アーチャーprt face=喜 pos=center time=400 twno=1]More importantly...I have an idea. Hear me out."::
44782::$$$message_0390_0000_0055$$$::"Hm?"::
44783::$$$message_0390_0000_0056$$$::"Hm?"::
44784::$$$message_0390_0000_0057$$$::"Onsen are the greatest leisure this country has. I hear they're getaways for lovers and married couples."::
44785::$$$message_0390_0000_0058$$$::"So, how about this? The man with the greatest exploits on this expedition gets to stay in Ayaka's room."::
44786::$$$message_0390_0000_0059$$$::"Surely she won't object to a reward for fighting well. After the mind and body are softened by a hot bath, the atmosphere is ripe for romance."::
44787::$$$message_0390_0000_0060$$$::"..."::
44788::$$$message_0390_0000_0061$$$::"Damn, mate. What's going on in that head of yours? Do you get dumped by women a lot?"::
44789::$$$message_0390_0000_0062$$$::"It can't be avoided. Debauchery is a king's duty. I have an obligation to delight in fruit and flesh."::
44790::$$$message_0390_0000_0063$$$::"But my true affection is for a singular flower. I'm sick of base meat and sour drink."::
44791::$$$message_0390_0000_0064$$$::"What say you, Saber, Lancer? Will you make a knightly oath?"::
44792::$$$message_0390_0000_0065$$$::"I think we should keep this a secret from the lass."::
44793::$$$message_0390_0000_0066$$$::"Very well, I accept. The most accomplished of us will share a room with Ayaka, yes?"::
44794::$$$message_0390_0000_0067$$$::"You're up for this!?"::
44795::$$$message_0390_0000_0068$$$::"Archer's proposal makes sense. Until today, I never imagined that I would think of this man as my friend."::
44796::$$$message_0390_0000_0069$$$::"...Damn. Well, no use worrying now. [wvl canskip=false time=150][hffgchg2 chara=ランサーprt face=笑顔 pos=right time=300 twno=2][hfsigh layer=1]Count me in, too. I don't like having my food eaten right in front of me."::
44797::$$$message_0390_0000_0070$$$::"Hahaha, well said, hound! Then let us compete to be Ayaka's bedmate, fair and square!"'::
44798::$$$message_0390_0000_0071$$$::"Thanks for waiting. [wvl canskip=false time=150][hffgchg2 chara=綾香 face=楽2 pos=right time=400 twno=1]Huh? What are you three doing? Since when have you been so buddy-buddy?"::
44799::$$$message_0390_0000_0072$$$::"O-oh, we were just having a quick meeting. Don't worry about it. I'll tell you once the war is over."::
44800::$$$message_0390_0000_0073$$$::"Okay... [wvl canskip=false time=300][hffgchg2 chara=綾香 face=喜2 pos=right time=400 twno=1][hfwww layer=1]Then let's go. I don't know anything about Fuyuki's Holy Grail War, but we'll show them how veterans do it!":��a